error: rsjs boundary: `rsjs::island(...)` cannot capture parent rsjs handler `on_press`

       Why:
         Explicit child islands hydrate as independent client scopes. A parent handler closes over parent client state, so it cannot be serialized into the child island as an ordinary prop.

       Use one of:
         - Render the component directly inside the parent island so callback slots can inline.
         - Give the child island independent state and communicate through query, mutation, or a custom event.
         - Pass `rsjs::noop_handler()` when the child boundary should be inert.

       Tracked feature:
         component.island_boundary_handler_prop
